# Catpasswd Hash Extract

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture.md` before changing product behavior.
- Goal: unified multi-format, multi-platform hash extraction with a stable `HashResult` for John/hashcat/exporters.
- Keep docs and UI neutral and open-source focused.
- Align docs with **logic and constraints**, not folder trees. Keep docs short.
- Extraction in Rust via Tauri IPC; first-party native extractors only in production.
- Update `docs/architecture.md` when changing flows, `HashResult`, formats, or privacy rules.
